## 1. HIGH-LEVEL SUMMARY

Project Name: PromptOS
Purpose: A lightweight, conversion-optimized web platform to sell a 9-prompt 
         framework system for building AI applications

Core Value: Instant purchase → Instant unlock → Zero friction
Target Launch: 2-3 weeks
Revenue Model: UPI payments with tiered pricing (₹1-₹999)

### What It Does:
- Displays 9 premium prompts as "unlockable modules"
- Accepts payments through UPI (PhonePe, GPay, Paytm)
- Unlocks prompts instantly after purchase
- Minimal auth (email-only verification)
- Gen-Z aesthetic: clean, minimal, Apple-inspired
- Mobile-first responsive design

### What It Doesn't Do:
- No complex user accounts
- No subscription management
- No social features
- No admin dashboard (initially)

---

## 2. CORE FEATURES

### F1: Landing Page
- Hero section with bold headline
- 9 prompt modules displayed as cards
- Pricing clearly visible
- Trust indicators
- FAQ section
- Payment buttons embedded

Acceptance Criteria:
✅ Loads in under 2 seconds
✅ Mobile responsive (works on iPhone/Android)
✅ All 9 prompts visible
✅ Payment buttons are prominent and clickable

### F2: Payment Processing (UPI)
- PhonePe, GPay, Paytm integration
- UPI ID payment option
- Support for ₹0, ₹249, ₹349, ₹549, ₹999 tiers
- Automatic redirect after payment

### F3: Email Verification (Magic Links)
- User enters email before/after purchase
- Receives magic link to access purchased prompts
- No password required
- Session lasts 30 days

### F4: Prompt Unlock System
- After payment, user sees the full prompt
- Options: Copy to clipboard, Download
- Prompt displayed in clean, readable format
- Markdown rendering for formatted prompts

