## 5. USER STORIES

### Basic User Stories
US1: As a visitor, I want to see all 9 prompts clearly so I can decide which to buy
US2: As a buyer, I want to pay quickly (under 1 minute) so I don't lose interest
US3: As a buyer, I want to unlock my prompt immediately after payment
US4: As a user, I want to copy the prompt with one click
US5: As a returning user, I want to access my purchased prompts easily

