## 7. USER FLOW

```
Visitor lands on homepage
        ↓
Scrolls through 9 prompt modules
        ↓
Clicks "Unlock Prompt 4 - ₹349"
        ↓
UPI payment modal opens (PhonePe/GPay/Paytm/UPI ID)
        ↓
Completes payment
        ↓
Redirected to /unlock page
        ↓
Sees full prompt + clicks "Copy"
        ↓
Can re-access anytime via email
```

